  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Inclusive, Sustainable and Resilient Food systems in the Rural and Peri-urban Areas of the Cayo District, as a Response to the COVID-19</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Government of Belize implements an integrated mechanism using business incubator services and technological tools and approaches to match business opportunities presented in the agro-food system with special attention for income generating and employment opportunities of the most vulnerable groups, including youth and women living in the rural and peri-urban areas of the Cayo District</narrative>
  </description>
